### Generate AI Recommendations (Authenticated User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/recommend
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IlRabGxpVjdtTm13V1AxVHYiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..HlvqLD0HVJqy681vT9xF5aNaxONGYXz076ztTRAk0TU

### Get User Profile (Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/career/profile
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IlRabGxpVjdtTm13V1AxVHYiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..rAxZ97knf1vy_QL5pKipe3spitZz9YoCaMKYJ2TjkoA


### Get Active Session (Authenticated User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/career/session/active
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsImtpZCI6IlRabGxpVjdtTm13V1AxVHYiLCJ0eXAiOiJKV1QifQ..rAxZ97knf1vy_QL5pKipe3spitZz9YoCaMKYJ2TjkoA


### Get Session Details (Replace SESSION_ID)
@sessionId = 65f8a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d0
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/career/session/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Send Chat Message (Replace SESSION_ID)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/chat/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Can you tell me more about the job market for Computer Science in Pakistan?"
}

### Send Another Chat Message
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/chat/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What skills should I focus on developing for a career in AI?"
}

### Get Session Analytics (Replace SESSION_ID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/career/analytics/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

