### Generate AI Recommendations (Guest User)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/recommend
x-guest-id: {{guestId}}

### Get Guest Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/career/profile
x-guest-id: {{guestId}}

### Get Active Session (Guest User)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/career/session/active
x-guest-id: {{guestId}}

### Send Chat Message (Guest User - Replace SESSION_ID)
@guestSessionId = 65f8a1b2c3d4e5f6a7b8c9d1
