x-guest-id: {{guestId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "What are the salary expectations for a Data Analyst in Pakistan?"
}

###############################################
# ERROR SCENARIOS / VALIDATION TESTS
###############################################

### Submit Profile Without Auth (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "academic_level": "intermediate",
    "field_of_study": "science"
  }
}

### Generate Recommendations Without Auth (Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/recommend

### Submit Profile With Invalid Data (Missing Required Fields)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "academic_level": "intermediate"
  }
}

### Submit Profile With Invalid Values
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": {
    "academic_level": "invalid_level",
    "field_of_study": "computer_science",
    "academic_performance": "excellent",
    "favorite_subjects": ["Math"],
    "enjoy_solving_logical_problems": 10
  }
}

### Send Chat Message Without Message Body
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/chat/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Send Chat Message Too Long (Over 2000 chars)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/career/chat/{{sessionId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat. Duis aute irure dolor in reprehenderit in voluptate velit esse cillum dolore eu fugiat nulla pariatur. Excepteur sint occaecat cupidatat non proident, sunt in culpa qui officia deserunt mollit anim id est laborum. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut ali